@startuml Clinical_Audit_Rollback_Microservices
autonumber "<b>[00]</b>"
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10
skinparam Shadowing false
skinparam RoundCorner 8
skinparam DefaultFontSize 12
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #555555
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FEFECE
skinparam NoteBorderColor #A8A8A8

actor "Administrator\n(Medical Board)" as Admin

box "API Gateway Tier" #F0F7FF
    boundary "Respira.Gateway\n(YARP Reverse Proxy)" as Gateway
end box

box "Clinical Microservice (Respira.Clinical)" #FAFAFA
    control "ClinicalAuditController\n(REST API)" as Controller
    entity "ClinicalRollbackService\n(Domain Service)" as Service
    database "Clinical PostgreSQL\n(Domain & Outbox DB)" as DB
    control "AuditOutboxForwarder\n(Background Service)" as Outbox
end box

box "Message Broker & Central Saga Tier" #FFFDF0
    queue "RabbitMQ\n(AuditQueues.Events)" as Broker
    control "Respira.Saga\n(Wolverine Consumer)" as Saga
    database "Central PostgreSQL\n(Central Audit DB)" as CentralDB
end box

== Giai đoạn 1: Preview Rollback (Dry-Run Simulation) ==

Admin -> Gateway : POST /api/v1/clinical/audit-logs/rollback/range/preview\nAuthorization: Bearer <JWT>\n{ startAuditId, endAuditId, reason }
activate Gateway

Gateway -> Gateway : Verify JWT & check 'AdminOnly' policy
Gateway -> Controller : Forward request with injected headers\n[X-ID: {adminId}, X-Role: 'Admin']
activate Controller

Controller -> Service : PreviewRangeAsync(request, cancellationToken)
activate Service

Service -> DB : SELECT * FROM audit_entries\nWHERE id BETWEEN @Start AND @End AND is_rolled_back = false\nORDER BY id DESC
activate DB
DB --> Service : List<AuditEntry> (LIFO order: newest -> oldest)
deactivate DB

note over Service, DB
  <b>Isolated Simulation Transaction</b>
  Khởi tạo transaction riêng biệt để mô phỏng
  toàn bộ thao tác hoàn tác mà không làm ô nhiễm DB
end note

Service -> DB : BeginTransactionAsync(IsolationLevel.ReadCommitted)
activate DB

loop For each changeset in reverse order (LIFO)
    Service -> DB : SELECT current state of target Entity (id, type)
    activate DB
    DB --> Service : CurrentEntityState
    deactivate DB

    Service -> Service : Detect Conflicts\n- Entity modified by newer transaction outside range?\n- Entity already deleted?\n- Foreign key constraints violated?

    alt Conflict detected
        Service -> Service : Record conflict into preview.Conflicts
    else No conflict
        Service -> DB : Simulate reverse mutation in temporary transaction
        activate DB
        DB --> Service : Mutation acknowledged
        deactivate DB
    end
end

Service -> DB : RollbackAsync() [Abort simulation transaction]
deactivate DB

Service --> Controller : ClinicalRollbackRangePreview\n{ hasConflicts, conflicts, affectedCount, changes }
deactivate Service

Controller --> Gateway : 200 OK (ClinicalRollbackRangePreview)
deactivate Controller

Gateway --> Admin : 200 OK (Preview Report & Conflict Warnings)
deactivate Gateway

== Giai đoạn 2: Execute Rollback (Atomic LIFO Transaction) ==

Admin -> Gateway : POST /api/v1/clinical/audit-logs/rollback/range\nAuthorization: Bearer <JWT>\n{ startAuditId, endAuditId, reason }
activate Gateway

Gateway -> Gateway : Verify JWT & Claims
Gateway -> Controller : Forward request with injected headers\n[X-ID: {adminId}, X-Role: 'Admin']
activate Controller

Controller -> Service : ApplyRangeAsync(request, cancellationToken)
activate Service

Service -> DB : BeginTransactionAsync(IsolationLevel.ReadCommitted)
activate DB

Service -> DB : SELECT * FROM audit_entries\nWHERE id BETWEEN @Start AND @End\nORDER BY id DESC FOR UPDATE
activate DB
DB --> Service : Changesets (LIFO)
deactivate DB

alt Pre-execution Conflict Detected (Data changed during preview)
    Service -> DB : RollbackAsync()
    deactivate DB
    Service --> Controller : Throw ClinicalRollbackRangeConflictException
    Controller --> Gateway : 409 Conflict\n{ error: "RollbackConflict", conflicts: [...] }
    Gateway --> Admin : 409 Conflict (Rollback aborted - Data mismatch)
else Pre-conditions Valid (Proceed Atomic Revert)
    loop For each changeset in reverse order (LIFO)
        alt Original Action == INSERT
            Service -> DB : DELETE FROM entities WHERE id = @EntityId
        else Original Action == DELETE
            Service -> DB : INSERT INTO entities (Reconstruct from OldValues)
        else Original Action == UPDATE
            Service -> DB : UPDATE entities SET changed_columns = old_values\nWHERE id = @EntityId
        end

        Service -> DB : UPDATE audit_entries\nSET is_rolled_back = true, rolled_back_at = @UtcNow, rolled_back_by = @AdminId\nWHERE id = @AuditId
    end

    note over Service, DB
      <b>Transactional Outbox Pattern</b>
      Ghi nhận sự kiện rollback vào bảng audit_entries
      cùng trong transaction nghiệp vụ
    end note

    Service -> DB : INSERT INTO audit_entries\n(action = "Clinical.AuditRollbackRange", payload = {...}, forwarded_at = NULL)
    Service -> DB : CommitAsync() [ACID Commit]
    deactivate DB

    Service --> Controller : ClinicalRollbackRangeResult\n{ success = true, rolledBackCount, timestamp }
    Controller --> Gateway : 200 OK (ClinicalRollbackRangeResult)
    Gateway --> Admin : 200 OK (Range Rollback Executed Successfully)
end

deactivate Service
deactivate Controller
deactivate Gateway

== Giai đoạn 3: Asynchronous Outbox Event & Central Saga Replication ==

note over Outbox, DB
  Background Service chạy theo chu kỳ (polling 2s)
  đảm bảo At-Least-Once Delivery mà không block API call của client
end note

Outbox -> DB : SELECT * FROM audit_entries\nWHERE forwarded_at IS NULL ORDER BY created_at ASC LIMIT 50
activate DB
DB --> Outbox : List<AuditEntry> [including "Clinical.AuditRollbackRange"]
deactivate DB

Outbox ->> Broker : Publish Asynchronous Event\nExchange: audit.events | RoutingKey: clinical.audit.rollback\nPayload: { auditId, action, range, actorId, timestamp }
activate Broker

Outbox -> DB : UPDATE audit_entries SET forwarded_at = @UtcNow WHERE id = @AuditId
activate DB
DB --> Outbox : Updated
deactivate DB

Broker ->> Saga : Deliver message to Consumer\n(RecordSagaAuditEventHandler)
deactivate Broker
activate Saga

Saga -> CentralDB : INSERT INTO audit_logs\n(trace_id, microservice = "Clinical", action = "Clinical.AuditRollbackRange", payload, ...)\nON CONFLICT DO NOTHING (Idempotency)
activate CentralDB
CentralDB --> Saga : 1 row inserted
deactivate CentralDB

Saga ->> Broker : BasicAck(deliveryTag)
deactivate Saga

@enduml
